---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Aegis-Beacon v5.4 | Open Source Emergency Radio System"
  description="Low-cost emergency radio-location system based on LoRa for mountain rescue and SAR operations."
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      Open Source Emergency Radio
    </div>
    <h1>Aegis-Beacon</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">v5.4 // LoRa Emergency System</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      Low-cost emergency radio-location system based on LoRa. Designed for mountain rescue,
      land operations, and critical civilian scenarios when cellular infrastructure is unavailable.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/wiki/project-overview" class="btn-primary">Explore Wiki</a>
      <a href="/demo" class="btn-secondary">Live Demo</a>
      <a href="/builder" class="btn-secondary">BOM Builder</a>
    </div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">$23-28</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Total BOM Cost</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">410-525</span>
        <span class="stat-label">MHz Frequency</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">65h+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Beacon Runtime</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">15 km</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Maximum Range</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">10 uA</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Deep Sleep</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <span class="stat-value">4</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Operating Modes</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Features -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Core Capabilities</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Every component selected for reliability when lives depend on it.</p>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Long-Range Emergency Radio</h3>
        <p>SX1262 transceiver with +30 dBm PA delivers emergency beacon transmissions up to 15 km line-of-sight across the 410-525 MHz band.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Ultra-Low Power Design</h3>
        <p>Deep sleep at 10 microamps with 30-second hardware watchdog. WiFi and Bluetooth disabled in beacon mode for maximum battery life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>No Infrastructure Required</h3>
        <p>No GSM, WiFi, or commercial satellite needed. Direct peer-to-peer radio communication works anywhere in the wilderness.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>MIT Licensed Open Source</h3>
        <p>Full source code, hardware schematics, and BOM under MIT license. Community-driven development with PlatformIO support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>CW Morse Beacon with GPS</h3>
        <p>Continuous-wave beacon transmitting SOS and GPS coordinates for search-and-rescue operations. Compliant with PMR446 protocols.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>WiFi Config Portal</h3>
        <p>Captive portal at 192.168.4.1 for field configuration. Adjust frequencies, WPM, power output, and GPS settings without reflashing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Modes -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Operating Modes</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">From passive beacon to emergency high-power output.</p>
    <div class="modes-grid">
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">BEACON</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">01</span>
        </div>
        <p>Transmits Morse SOS with GPS coordinates on all configured frequencies, then enters deep sleep cycle for maximum runtime.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>TX: +17 dBm</span>
          <span>LED: Red</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">SEARCH</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">02</span>
        </div>
        <p>Scans all frequencies sequentially, measuring RSSI on each. Rising-pitch audio alert when signal is detected.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>TX: Rx only</span>
          <span>LED: Blue</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">CONFIG</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">03</span>
        </div>
        <p>WiFi AP mode with captive portal dashboard. Adjust all settings via browser without reflashing the firmware.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>TX: WiFi AP</span>
          <span>LED: Both</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-card">
        <div class="mode-header">
          <span class="mode-dot"></span>
          <span class="mode-name">EMERGENCY</span>
          <span class="mode-tag">04</span>
        </div>
        <p>Maximum power continuous TX with full payload. No deep sleep. 1760 Hz audible tone for critical rescue situations.</p>
        <div class="mode-meta">
          <span>TX: +22 dBm</span>
          <span>LED: Red fast</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Tech Stack -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2>Technology Stack</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Powered by industry-standard components and open-source tools.</p>
    <div class="tech-grid">
      <div class="tech-chip"><strong>ESP32</strong> Dual-Core MCU</div>
      <div class="tech-chip"><strong>SX1262</strong> LoRa Transceiver</div>
      <div class="tech-chip"><strong>SSD1309</strong> OLED Display</div>
      <div class="tech-chip"><strong>NEO-6M</strong> GPS Module</div>
      <div class="tech-chip"><strong>RadioLib</strong> RF Library</div>
      <div class="tech-chip"><strong>PlatformIO</strong> Build System</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <h2>Ready to Build Your Own?</h2>
    <p>Complete documentation, step-by-step assembly guide, interactive firmware demo, and BOM calculator.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/wiki/project-overview" class="btn-white">Full Build Wiki</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Leo-Galli/Aegis-Beacon" target="_blank" class="btn-outline">Source Code</a>
      <a href="/builder" class="btn-outline">BOM Calculator</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    background: #0f172a;
    color: white;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.375rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.3);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f97316;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: #f97316;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; }
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #f97316;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: #f97316;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #ea580c; }
  .btn-secondary {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); } }
  .stat { text-align: center; }
  .stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #fbbf24);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .stat-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .section-alt { background: var(--border-subtle); }
  .section-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .section-desc {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  /* Features */
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  .feature-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface);
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover { border-color: var(--text-muted); }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* Modes */
  .modes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .modes-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .modes-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
  .mode-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .mode-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .mode-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .mode-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .mode-tag {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .mode-card p { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .mode-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* Tech */
  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .tech-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .tech-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); } }
  .tech-chip {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .tech-chip strong { font-weight: 600; }

  /* CTA */
  .cta { background: #f97316; color: white; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .cta-inner { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .cta h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .cta p { font-size: 1rem; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-white {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    color: #ea580c;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .btn-white:hover { background: #fff7ed; }
  .btn-outline {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }

  /* Responsive hero */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
